sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Tx1 as Transaction 1
    participant RowA as Row A (Account 101)
    participant RowB as Row B (Account 202)
    participant Tx2 as Transaction 2
    participant DB as DB Deadlock Detector

    Tx1->>RowA: Acquires Exclusive Lock (Row A)
    Tx2->>RowB: Acquires Exclusive Lock (Row B)
    
    Tx1->>RowB: Requests Lock on Row B (BLOCKED - Waiting for Tx2)
    Tx2->>RowA: Requests Lock on Row A (BLOCKED - Waiting for Tx1)

    Note over Tx1,Tx2: Circular Wait Condition: Tx1 waits for Tx2, Tx2 waits for Tx1
    DB->>DB: Wait-For Graph Cycle Detected!
    DB-->>Tx2: ERROR 1213 (40001): Deadlock found when trying to get lock; Tx2 aborted (Rollback)
    Note over Tx1: Tx1 acquires Lock on Row B and completes
